{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120381","id":3886837861,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7nrHBl","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120381","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120381.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120381.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120381","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120381/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120381/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120381/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/29f5f4d18f293ec31ab48d4c896802d7a8c7a936","number":120381,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Callable support to EditorUndoRedoManager","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nI've seen people asking from time to time why EditorUndoRedoManager does not support Callables, like UndoRedo. The answer is always that live editing expects a regular callables, hence the API does not allow anything fancy.\r\nHowever there are some use-cases where you don't really care about live editing, or just using a custom callable is easier.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new method to EditorUndoRedoManager that allows adding operations which are explicitly excluded from all UndoRedo hooks. Meaning the editor will not try to send the Callable to running project, so you can use any Callable, even ones that aren't supported.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url